  "html": "<div>\n<b>Taip pat skaitykite: <a href=\"/2016/10/vakaru-rito-staciatikybe.html\"><i>Vakarų rito stačiatikybė</i></a></b></div>\n<b><br></b>\n<br>\n<table align=\"center\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\"><tbody>\n<tr><td><b><img border=\"0\" height=\"199\" src=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20191020061016im_/https://4.bp.blogspot.com/-wPx9Awrsbfw/WAP4rtjbj9I/AAAAAAAALMM/qFaA9BNCXYQGegX5eQfp5505I_Cp31rJwCLcB/s320/The%2Bconsecration%2Bof%2BThe%2BRt.%2BRev%2BWeller%2Bas%2Ban%2BAnglican%2Bbishop%2Bat%2Bthe%2BCathedral%2Bof%2BSt.%2BPaul%2Bthe%2BApostle.jpg\" width=\"320\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></b></td></tr>\n<tr><td><b>Šv. Tichonas (dešinėje) su Vakarų rito neortodoksais vyskupais</b></td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div>\n<a href=\"https://4.bp.blogspot.com/-wPx9Awrsbfw/WAP4rtjbj9I/AAAAAAAALMM/qFaA9BNCXYQGegX5eQfp5505I_Cp31rJwCLcB/s1600/The%2Bconsecration%2Bof%2BThe%2BRt.%2BRev%2BWeller%2Bas%2Ban%2BAnglican%2Bbishop%2Bat%2Bthe%2BCathedral%2Bof%2BSt.%2BPaul%2Bthe%2BApostle.jpg\" imageanchor=\"1\" rel=\"noreferrer\"><b></b></a></div>\n<b>ORTODOKSŲ PAMALDOS&nbsp;</b><br>\n<b></b><br>\n<div>\n<b><br></b></div>\n<b>\n<div>\nNuotraukos iš ortodoksų dievogarbos.</div>\n<br><div>\n<table align=\"center\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\"><tbody>\n<tr><td><img border=\"0\" height=\"213\" src=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20191020061016im_/https://4.bp.blogspot.com/-V0wJs_WXFwE/WAP4toFZQYI/AAAAAAAALMk/cIDolLggB50Sm-Prm-llcSh3Y-CDV2EBACLcB/s320/rocor%2Bsarum%2Bwr%2BJerome-in-Oxford.jpg\" width=\"320\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></td></tr>\n<tr><td>Rusijos Ortodoksų Bažnyčios Užsienyje (ROCOR) <br>\nSarumo rito pamaldos</td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<table align=\"center\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\"><tbody>\n<tr><td><a href=\"https://1.bp.blogspot.com/-AXqTK73dJyI/WAP4rKKwGSI/AAAAAAAALME/dEl8ONAUBYMvpvlbgotGIounO8XEPrdJACLcB/s1600/Saint%2BJohn%2B%2528Maximovitch%2529%2Bof%2BShanghai%2Bcelebrating%2Bthe%2BWestern%2BRite%2Bwith%2BWestern%2BRite%2BOrthodox%2Bin%2BParis%2BGaliskoji%2Bliturgija..jpg\" imageanchor=\"1\" rel=\"noreferrer\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"320\" src=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20191020061016im_/https://1.bp.blogspot.com/-AXqTK73dJyI/WAP4rKKwGSI/AAAAAAAALME/dEl8ONAUBYMvpvlbgotGIounO8XEPrdJACLcB/s320/Saint%2BJohn%2B%2528Maximovitch%2529%2Bof%2BShanghai%2Bcelebrating%2Bthe%2BWestern%2BRite%2Bwith%2BWestern%2BRite%2BOrthodox%2Bin%2BParis%2BGaliskoji%2Bliturgija..jpg\" width=\"314\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></a></td></tr>\n<tr><td>Šv. Jonas Sanfransiskietis švenčia (modifikuotas?) Tridento šv. Mišias</td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n</div>\n<table align=\"center\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\"><tbody>\n<tr><td><img border=\"0\" height=\"320\" src=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20191020061016im_/https://4.bp.blogspot.com/-C78Qd5kayS0/WAP4p5chQ0I/AAAAAAAALLs/7HLDocqa9aIK7618zU0vykRflsptPYaFwCLcB/s320/Bishop%2BJean-Nectaire%2B%2528Kovalevsky%2529%2Bof%2BSaint-Denis%2Band%2BSt.%2BJohn%2BMaximovitch%2Bin%2B1964.jpg\" width=\"216\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></td></tr>\n<tr><td>Šv. Jonas Sanfransiskietis (dešinėje) <br>\nsu ortodoksų Vakarų rito vyskupu (kairėje)</td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n</b><br>\n<table align=\"center\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\"><tbody>\n<tr><td><a href=\"https://1.bp.blogspot.com/-KRaotNeuabE/WAP4qhHFl9I/AAAAAAAALL4/fH3U6BP1D-AFlKF9TPHKqnHGWkaBw7wDACLcB/s1600/Holy%2BIncarnation%2BWestern%2BRite%2BOrthodox%2BChurch%2Bin%2BDetroit.jpg\" imageanchor=\"1\" rel=\"noreferrer\"><b><img border=\"0\" height=\"210\" src=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20191020061016im_/https://1.bp.blogspot.com/-KRaotNeuabE/WAP4qhHFl9I/AAAAAAAALL4/fH3U6BP1D-AFlKF9TPHKqnHGWkaBw7wDACLcB/s320/Holy%2BIncarnation%2BWestern%2BRite%2BOrthodox%2BChurch%2Bin%2BDetroit.jpg\" width=\"320\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></b></a></td></tr>\n<tr><td><b>Vakarų rito pamaldos Antiochijos patriarchate</b></td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<b></b><br>\n<table align=\"center\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\"><tbody>\n<tr><td><img border=\"0\" height=\"240\" src=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20191020061016im_/https://2.bp.blogspot.com/-EUaFj1HQSYs/WAP4sdXKm9I/AAAAAAAALMU/saOdsf_lVkM9MHLpcckHRS929rPs-CAcQCLcB/s320/antioch%2Bwestern%2Bbp_john_leading_the_confiteor.preview.jpg\" width=\"320\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></td></tr>\n<tr><td><span>Vakarų rito pamaldos Antiochijos patriarchate</span></td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<table align=\"center\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\"><tbody>\n<tr><td><b><img border=\"0\" height=\"240\" src=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20191020061016im_/https://1.bp.blogspot.com/-f51mNeU5YnQ/WAP4pTQkkXI/AAAAAAAALLg/JUeGswGjTLQJz3in0TyY3n6qZgxptbEbQCLcB/s320/12042636_1587082774945961_5344762642571117804_n.jpg\" width=\"320\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></b></td></tr>\n<tr><td><b>Vakarų rito (Sarumo) atstovai atskilusioje <br>senojo kalendoriaus ROCOR organizacijoje</b></td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<table align=\"center\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\"><tbody>\n<tr><td><b><img border=\"0\" height=\"213\" src=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20191020061016im_/https://4.bp.blogspot.com/-BMz5kqmhdTs/WAP4sJsSHFI/AAAAAAAALMQ/E-rSudujltcmhyBWgQCRvLVQvXHd0kYZwCLcB/s320/The%2BRood%2BScreen%2Bat%2Bour%2BChurch%2Bof%2Bthe%2BHoly%2BTransfiguration%2Bon%2BMt.%2BOverlook%252C%2BWoodstock%252C%2BNew%2BYork..jpg\" width=\"320\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></b></td></tr>\n<tr><td><b>ROCOR senojo kalendoriaus sinodo <br>Vakarų rito bažnyčios vidus</b></td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div>\n<a href=\"https://4.bp.blogspot.com/-BMz5kqmhdTs/WAP4sJsSHFI/AAAAAAAALMQ/E-rSudujltcmhyBWgQCRvLVQvXHd0kYZwCLcB/s1600/The%2BRood%2BScreen%2Bat%2Bour%2BChurch%2Bof%2Bthe%2BHoly%2BTransfiguration%2Bon%2BMt.%2BOverlook%252C%2BWoodstock%252C%2BNew%2BYork..jpg\" imageanchor=\"1\" rel=\"noreferrer\"><b></b></a></div>\n<div>\n<a href=\"https://1.bp.blogspot.com/-f51mNeU5YnQ/WAP4pTQkkXI/AAAAAAAALLg/JUeGswGjTLQJz3in0TyY3n6qZgxpt